<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVkd&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Logo"></font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Ref No: {!Case.CaseNumber}</font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Dear {!Case.First_Name__c},</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Thank you for your comments regarding your booking from {!Case.Departure_City__c} to {!Case.Arrival_City__c}.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><b><i><font size="2">-If unhappy with Change Fees use:-</font></i></b></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">I regret your unhappiness with the cost of changing your ticket. To ensure we meet all our customers’ needs, we offer a variety of fare types ranging from fully flexible tickets to cheaper, more restrictive fares. I have looked at your booking and can see that the fare you purchased <b><i>-via Qantas.com-</i></b> was one of our discounted fares, so fees do apply when making changes.&nbsp;</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><b><i><font size="2">-If booked online add:-</font></i></b></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">While I understand you were not expecting the fees, the Fare Conditions are clearly displayed on the main booking page of qantas.com and customers are required to check the box stating ‘I have read and accept the Fare Conditions above’ before they can complete their booking. Providing this information allows our customers to choose the fare that is most appropriate for their needs.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><b><i><font size="2">-If booked via Contact Centres add:-</font></i></b></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">While I understand you were not expecting the fees, the Fare Conditions are clearly explained at the time of booking and I can see that our staff advised you of this when you called to book on <b><i>-DATE-</i></b>.&nbsp;Providing this information allows our customers to choose the fare that is most appropriate for their needs.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><b><i><font size="2">-If unhappy with assisted Booking Fee:-</font></i></b></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">I regret your disappointment at being charged an assisted booking fee. We charge a fee when you make a booking through our Contact Centres or Airport Sales Desks, to cover the administration costs of processing your reservation. You can avoid this fee in future, by booking online at qantas.com.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><b><i><font size="2">-If unhappy with assisted Change Fee:-</font></i></b></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">I regret your disappointment at being charged an assisted change fee. We introduced the option for our customers to avoid service fees, by making many simple changes themselves online at qantas.com. Making complicated changes, that require the specialised service and expertise of our Contact Centre, Airport, Web Chat and Social Media teams does attract a fee, and this helps contribute to the administration costs of processing your reservation.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">I am unable to meet your request for a refund of the fees, as they were charged correctly. I can provide a letter for your insurance company, if wish to make a claim for the fees through your travel insurer. Please let me know if you require this letter.&nbsp;</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">We appreciate you taking the time to provide your feedback and hope we have to opportunity to welcome you on board Qantas in the future.</font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Kind regards</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">{!User.FirstName}</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Qantas Customer Care</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVke&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Qantas_Logo"></font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""></p><p style="text-align: center;"><span style="color: black; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><font size="2">{!Case.Thread_Token}</font></span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2">Qantas Airways Limited, ABN 16 009 661 901</font></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2">10 Bourke Road Mascot NSW 2020 Australia&nbsp;</font></p><p style="text-align: center;"><br></p><p style="font-size: 12pt; text-align: center;"><span style="text-align: left; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************** PLEASE CONSIDER OUR ENVIRONMENT BEFORE PRINTING *****************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="1" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="text-align: left;">*********************************************** Confidentiality and Privilege Notice **********************************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font></p><p><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">This e-mail is intended only to be read or used by the addressee. It is confidential and may contain legally privileged information. If you are not the addressee indicated in this message (or responsible for delivery of the message to such person), you may not copy or deliver this message to anyone, and you should destroy this message and kindly notify the sender by reply e-mail. Confidentiality and legal privilege are not waived or lost by</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">reason of mistaken delivery to you. Qantas Airways Limited ABN 16 009 661 901&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************************************************************************************************************************</span></p>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>